{{!--
    Post template: Immersive.

    Selectable per post in Ghost admin under Post settings → Template. Sets the
    title over a full-height feature image.

    On a post with no feature image it renders exactly like Standard. That is
    intentional: a publisher who picks this template and then removes the image
    should get a plain, correct post rather than a broken hero.
--}}
{{!< default}}

{{#post}}
    {{> "post-shell" layout="Immersive"}}
{{/post}}
